# ===== 文本文件：统一换行，避免 Unity 场景文件被 CRLF 污染 =====
*.cs      text diff=csharp
*.unity   text
*.prefab  text
*.asset   text
*.mat     text
*.anim    text
*.meta    text
*.json    text
*.md      text merge=union

# ===== 二进制文件：先当普通二进制处理 =====
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.fbx binary
*.obj binary
*.blend binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.pdf binary

